flowchart TD
  Open[Open Dashboard - Account Security] --> Load[GET connected methods]
  Load --> Connected{Method status}
  Connected -->|Connected| Disconnect[Offer Disconnect when policy permits]
  Connected -->|Not connected and enabled| Connect[Offer Connect]
  Connected -->|Unavailable| Explain[Show unavailable state]
  Connect --> Intent[Create signed link intent]
  Intent --> Provider[Authenticate with provider]
  Provider --> Linked[Link to current User]
  Disconnect --> Last{Last usable method?}
  Last -->|Yes| Block[Block LAST_SIGN_IN_METHOD]
  Last -->|No| Remove[Remove provider identity]
